    {
      "q": "What is the best way to get around Delhi?",
      "a": "The Delhi Metro is the fastest, cleanest, and most reliable way to navigate the city, connecting virtually all tourist attractions."
    },
    {
      "q": "How many days are needed to explore New Delhi?",
      "a": "A 3-day itinerary is recommended to cover the primary UNESCO monuments, Old Delhi markets, Lutyens’ government quarter, and major spiritual campuses."
    },
    {
      "q": "What are the top must-try street foods in Delhi?",
